# Classroom Management & Professional Development Workshop Framework

A comprehensive, evidence-based training curriculum and case-study toolkit designed for K-12 educators and instructional coaches. Adapted from Alberta Education's *Supporting Positive Behaviour in Alberta Schools* and core classroom management principles.

