<a id="overview"></a>
## Framework Overview

To maintain an orderly classroom, discipline must focus heavily on **prevention** before relying on reactive interventions. This framework follows a 3-Tiered Continuum of Support:

```text
               / \
              /   \    Tier 3: Intensive Individualized Supports (1–7%)
             /     \   (Behavior Support Plans, Individual De-escalation)
            /-------\
           /         \   Tier 2: Targeted Supports (5–15%)
          /           \  (Structured Redirection, Non-Verbal Interventions)
         /-------------\
        /               \  Tier 1: Universal Supports (80–85%)
       /                 \ (Positive Relationships, Parameters, Active Monitoring)
      ---------------------
